  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-EC_INTPA" secondary-reporter="0" type="15">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Commission - Directorate-General for International Partnerships</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;Investment Grant for the COVID-19 Health Response Ghana Project&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project contributes to the &#xbf;Team Europe&#xbf; response related to the COVID-19 pandemic, and is fully aligned with one of its pillars i.e. &#xbf;Strengthening health, water and sanitation systems, as well as partner countries&#xbf; capacities and preparedness to deal with the pandemic&#xbf;. The project consists of the financing of certain interventions aiming at strengthening the emergency response to the COVID-19 crisis, as well as financing the overall strengthening of the country&#xbf;s resilience and pandemic preparedness included in the Ghana National Strategic COVID-19 Response Plan. This includes, inter alia, acquisition of medical equipment, medicines and supplies, improving the healthcare infrastructure, logistics, supporting vaccination programmes as well as the strengthening of the overall medical heath system in respect to any potential future pandemic. A grant from the AIP is requested to co-finance these interventions. In addition to the Bank&#xbf;s standards, standards of WHO will be applied for all goods, equipment, vaccines and consumables to be financed under the project. Technical Assistance support to the Promoter in project implementation is also foreseen, to be financed under the EIB loan.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
